sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as KServe Ingress Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Istio as Istio Sidecar<br/>mTLS
    participant REST as OVMS REST API<br/>8888/TCP
    participant GRPC as OVMS gRPC API<br/>8001/TCP
    participant Engine as OpenVINO<br/>Inference Engine
    participant Storage as Model Storage<br/>/mnt/models
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over Client,Storage: Inference Request Flow (REST)
    Client->>Gateway: POST /v2/models/{model}:predict<br/>HTTPS/443
    Gateway->>Istio: Forward request<br/>TLS termination
    Istio->>REST: Forward (auth validated)<br/>Port 8888
    REST->>Engine: Execute inference
    Engine-->>REST: Prediction result
    REST-->>Istio: JSON response
    Istio-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>Client: HTTP 200 JSON

    Note over Client,Storage: Model Loading Flow
    Client->>Gateway: Create InferenceService CR
    Note right of Gateway: KServe creates pod<br/>with OVMS container
    REST->>Storage: Read --model_path<br/>from storageUri mount
    Storage-->>REST: Model artifacts
    REST->>Engine: Load model into<br/>OpenVINO runtime
    Engine-->>REST: Model ready

    Note over Client,Storage: Streaming Inference Flow (gRPC)
    Client->>Gateway: gRPC Connect<br/>Port 8001
    Gateway->>Istio: Forward stream
    Istio->>GRPC: Bidirectional stream
    GRPC->>Engine: ModelStreamInfer RPC<br/>MediaPipe graph instantiated
    Client->>GRPC: Stream request packets<br/>(monotonic timestamps)
    Engine-->>GRPC: Process via MediaPipe
    GRPC-->>Client: Stream response packets

    Note over Prom,REST: Metrics Scrape Flow
    Prom->>REST: GET /metrics<br/>Port 8888
    REST-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
